:
Current setting is hot fix of to make rare and very rare spell in lair to delay

Output 
RAREALLOWED = 1 if rare spells can be found, 0 otherwise.
VERYRAREALLOWED = 1 if very rare spells can be found
:

RAREALLOWED=1;
VERYRAREALLOWED=1;

K=9;
IF DIFFICULTY()>=DiffExpert THEN { K=K-(Difficulty()-6); }

IF (SCORINGOPTION(SAcceleratedRace)=0) THEN {
 IF OVERLANDTURN()<(K*12) THEN { VERYRAREALLOWED=0; }
 IF OVERLANDTURN()<((K*12)-60) THEN { RAREALLOWED=0; }
}
